  rect 48 16 14 32 3
  fill rad $skin $skind 22 16 80
  stroke $skinl 2.2
  path M 49 18 L 30 18 Q 19 20 18 32 Q 18 46 30 48 L 49 47 Z
  path M 15 19 L 32 21 Q 43 23 44 33 Q 44 44 34 46 L 15 47 Z
  rect 21 39 8 12 4
  rect 29 40.5 8 12 4
  rect 37 40 8 11.5 4
  ellipse 33 21 9 5 8

